  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 04277e5ae02784742ba1567b52d9bdc0, type: 3}
  m_Name: Eloquent
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  GroupName: Eloquent
  Responses: []
  AlwaysAvailable: "The radiant beauty of the light from your halos is matched only
    by your stunning physique! @JohnFox#99912158\r\nThank you for sharing the bounty
    of your presence, my Lord! You honor us. We are so lucky to bask in your shadow.
    Bless our days and may you be merciful with us! @Val \r\nLord, brave and true,
    I bid a smoocharoo from me to you @Theo\r\nI wake up early, whenever I can, and
    stare up dearly, to praise the ram! @FleeceCapich\xE9\r\nDear Lord, like our
    sun, stars and moon, your temperament may vary, but our love is immune. @Puck\r\nThe
    Great Ram breathes in. Us Sozans look up to him. The Great Ram breathes out.
    @HaiKuku\r\nRoses are red, violet is a hue, my day is never bad when praising
    you!@LinguistLion\r\nInto thine hands, organic and of DRAM, I commend my being,
    o lord of Rams! @DDDelight \r\nThe warmth of your light ignites my very spirit,
    Great Ram God! @Gunk4Hire"
  DayTwoAvailable: 
  DayThreeAvailable: 
  DayFourAvailable: 
  DayFiveAvailable: 
  GatedPrayersArray:
  - FirstToUnlock: 1
    Prayers: Our world he doth readily hold, Eyes of light and fleece white gold,
      With strength beyond what we behold, And leagues better than any puny kobold.
      @ProsePone
  PrayerDataList:
  - Prayer: The radiant beauty of the light from your halos is matched only by your
      stunning physique!
    Author: JohnFox#99912158
