  - Prayer: Thank you for sharing the bounty of your presence, my Lord! You honor
      us. We are so lucky to bask in your shadow. Bless our days and may you be merciful
      with us!
    Author: 'Val '
    SourcePrayer: {fileID: 11400000}
  - Prayer: Lord, brave and true, I bid a smoocharoo from me to you
    Author: Theo
    SourcePrayer: {fileID: 11400000}
  - Prayer: I wake up early, whenever I can, and stare up dearly, to praise the ram!
    Author: "FleeceCapich\xE9"
    SourcePrayer: {fileID: 11400000}
  - Prayer: Dear Lord, like our sun, stars and moon, your temperament may vary, but
      our love is immune.
    Author: Puck
    SourcePrayer: {fileID: 11400000}
  - Prayer: The Great Ram breathes in. Us Sozans look up to him. The Great Ram breathes
